# --- shipped landing assets ---
# The blanket *.mp4 above is right for renders, runs and evidence — those are
# build output. These two are PRODUCT: the landing's hero glide and its sample
# film. Ignored, they vanish from the Vercel build and the page deploys green
# with a black hero and no film, failing nothing. Track them explicitly.
!web/public/landing/*.mp4
